    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You learn to redirect an errant shot. If you miss with a ranged attack roll using a weapon with the Ammunition property, you can make the shot ricochet toward a new target as a Bonus Action immediately after the miss. The new target must be a creature you can see within the weapon's range and within 60 feet of the original target. Make an attack roll against it.</p>",
